    /*                   CONVERSION OPERATIONS                    */
    /*.•°:°.´+˚.*°.˚:*.´•*.+°.•°:´*.´•*.•°.•°:°.´:•˚°.*°.˚:*.´+°.•*/

    /// @notice Converts a boolean value to a uint256 representation.
    ///
